        "content": "<div style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-left:3px solid #64748b;background:rgba(100,116,139,0.10);line-height:1.2;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden\"><strong>Run Explorer</strong> · pick recent run → ID → accounting → actions. Exact-run forensic owner. Full paths live in report artifacts, not triage bodies.</div>"
